                                "sense_id": "2a82dae6-0103-37c9-8703-9672579cd7c0",
                                "text": "The company's executives mistakenly assumed that they could have a 20-person team cover the work of a 40-person team, causing the staff to be wholly outmatched and thus leading to missed quality defects."
